'''Canes''' is a [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
The blade is a bright red with many red and white candy canes, hence the name.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Canes (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name. 
